{"seq":2,"slug":"react-rendering-optimization","title":"React 渲染优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/performance-optimization/rendering-performance/react-rendering-optimization","wordCount":727,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"react-渲染优化\">React 渲染优化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>在 React 中，&quot;渲染&quot;指组件函数被调用生成 VDOM 的过程，它与&quot;真实 DOM 是否更新&quot;是两件事——只有当 diff 出差异时才会提交到 DOM。因此优化的重点是减少不必要的组件函数调用，而不是担心 DOM 操作。触发渲染的三种情况是自身状态变更、父组件重渲染、所消费的 Context 变更。对应手段：用 React.memo 跳过 props 未变的子组件，用 useMemo/useCallback 稳定昂贵的计算与函数引用，用状态下沉与 Context 拆分缩小更新范围，用 useTransition 把非紧急更新降级，以及用 DevTools Profiler 定位真正的渲染热点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"react-渲染机制\">React 渲染机制</h2><p>理解 React 的渲染机制是进行优化的前提。在 React 中，&quot;渲染&quot;指的是组件函数被调用生成 VDOM 的过程——这并不意味着真实 DOM 一定会更新。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;触发渲染 (状态变更)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;组件函数执行&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;生成新 VDOM&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Diff 新旧 VDOM&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{有差异?}&#10;    E --&gt;|是| F[&quot;更新真实 DOM (Commit)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|否| G[&quot;跳过 DOM 更新&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"触发渲染 (状态变更)\"] --&gt; B[\"组件函数执行\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"生成新 VDOM\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Diff 新旧 VDOM\"]\n    D --&gt; E{有差异?}\n    E --&gt;|是| F[\"更新真实 DOM (Commit)\"]\n    E --&gt;|否| G[\"跳过 DOM 更新\"]</pre><p>触发渲染的三种情况：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>组件自身状态变更</strong>（setState）</li>\n<li><strong>父组件重渲染</strong>（即使传入的 props 没变）</li>\n<li><strong>Context 值变更</strong>（消费该 Context 的所有组件）</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"react-memo-优化\">React.memo 优化</h2><p>当父组件重渲染时，所有子组件默认也会重渲染——即使它们的 props 没有变化。<code>React.memo</code> 通过浅比较 props 来跳过不必要的渲染。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { memo, useState } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface UserCardProps {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  email: string;&#10;  avatar: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const UserCard = memo(function UserCard({ name, email, avatar }: UserCardProps) {&#10;  console.log(&#39;UserCard rendered&#39;);&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div className=&quot;user-card&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;img src={avatar} alt={name} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;h3&gt;{name}&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;      &lt;p&gt;{email}&lt;/p&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;});&#10;&#10;function UserList() {&#10;  const [selectedId, setSelectedId] = useState&lt;string | null&gt;(null);&#10;  const users = useUsers();&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      {users.map((user) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;div key={user.id} onClick={() =&gt; setSelectedId(user.id)}&gt;&#10;          &lt;UserCard name={user.name} email={user.email} avatar={user.avatar} /&gt;&#10;          {selectedId === user.id &amp;&amp; &lt;span&gt;✓ Selected&lt;/span&gt;}&#10;        &lt;/div&gt;&#10;      ))}&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { memo, useState } from 'react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface UserCardProps {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  email: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  avatar: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const UserCard = memo(function UserCard({ name, email, avatar }: UserCardProps) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log('UserCard rendered');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div className=\"user-card\"></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;img src={avatar} alt={name} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;h3>{name}&#x3C;/h3></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;p>{email}&#x3C;/p></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function UserList() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [selectedId, setSelectedId] = useState&#x3C;string | null>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const users = useUsers();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {users.map((user) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;div key={user.id} onClick={() => setSelectedId(user.id)}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;UserCard name={user.name} email={user.email} avatar={user.avatar} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          {selectedId === user.id &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;span>✓ Selected&#x3C;/span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自定义比较函数\">自定义比较函数</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"interface ChartProps {&#10;  data: number[];&#10;  title: string;&#10;  config: { color: string; type: string };&#10;}&#10;&#10;const Chart = memo(&#10;  function Chart({ data, title, config }: ChartProps) {&#10;    return &lt;canvas data-title={title} /&gt;;&#10;  },&#10;  (prevProps, nextProps) =&gt; {&#10;    if (prevProps.title !== nextProps.title) return false;&#10;    if (prevProps.config.color !== nextProps.config.color) return false;&#10;    if (prevProps.config.type !== nextProps.config.type) return false;&#10;    if (prevProps.data.length !== nextProps.data.length) return false;&#10;    return prevProps.data.every((v, i) =&gt; v === nextProps.data[i]);&#10;  },&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface ChartProps {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  data: number[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  title: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  config: { color: string; type: string };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const Chart = memo(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  function Chart({ data, title, config }: ChartProps) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return &#x3C;canvas data-title={title} />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  (prevProps, nextProps) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (prevProps.title !== nextProps.title) return false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (prevProps.config.color !== nextProps.config.color) return false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (prevProps.config.type !== nextProps.config.type) return false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (prevProps.data.length !== nextProps.data.length) return false;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return prevProps.data.every((v, i) => v === nextProps.data[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"usememo-与-usecallback\">useMemo 与 useCallback</h2><h3 id=\"usememo-缓存计算结果\">useMemo：缓存计算结果</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { useMemo, useState } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface Product {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  name: string;&#10;  price: number;&#10;  category: string;&#10;  inStock: boolean;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function ProductList({ products }: { products: Product[] }) {&#10;  const [filter, setFilter] = useState(&#39;&#39;);&#10;  const [sortBy, setSortBy] = useState&lt;&#39;name&#39; | &#39;price&#39;&gt;(&#39;name&#39;);&#10;  const [showInStockOnly, setShowInStockOnly] = useState(false);&#10;&#10;  const filteredAndSorted = useMemo(() =&gt; {&#10;    let result = products;&#10;&#10;    if (showInStockOnly) {&#10;      result = result.filter((p) =&gt; p.inStock);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (filter) {&#10;      const lowerFilter = filter.toLowerCase();&#10;      result = result.filter(&#10;        (p) =&gt; p.name.toLowerCase().includes(lowerFilter) || p.category.toLowerCase().includes(lowerFilter),&#10;      );&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    return [...result].sort((a, b) =&gt; {&#10;      if (sortBy === &#39;name&#39;) return a.name.localeCompare(b.name);&#10;      return a.price - b.price;&#10;    });&#10;  }, [products, filter, sortBy, showInStockOnly]);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;input value={filter} onChange={(e) =&gt; setFilter(e.target.value)} placeholder=&quot;搜索...&quot; /&gt;&#10;      &lt;select value={sortBy} onChange={(e) =&gt; setSortBy(e.target.value as &#39;name&#39; | &#39;price&#39;)}&gt;&#10;        &lt;option value=&quot;name&quot;&gt;按名称&lt;/option&gt;&#10;        &lt;option value=&quot;price&quot;&gt;按价格&lt;/option&gt;&#10;      &lt;/select&gt;&#10;      &lt;label&gt;&#10;        &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; checked={showInStockOnly} onChange={(e) =&gt; setShowInStockOnly(e.target.checked)} /&gt;&#10;        仅显示有货&#10;      &lt;/label&gt;&#10;      &lt;div&gt;&#10;        {filteredAndSorted.map((product) =&gt; (&#10;          &lt;ProductItem key={product.id} product={product} /&gt;&#10;        ))}&#10;      &lt;/div&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { useMemo, useState } from 'react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Product {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  price: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  category: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  inStock: boolean;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function ProductList({ products }: { products: Product[] }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [filter, setFilter] = useState('');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [sortBy, setSortBy] = useState&#x3C;'name' | 'price'>('name');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [showInStockOnly, setShowInStockOnly] = useState(false);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const filteredAndSorted = useMemo(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let result = products;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (showInStockOnly) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      result = result.filter((p) => p.inStock);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (filter) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const lowerFilter = filter.toLowerCase();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      result = result.filter(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        (p) => p.name.toLowerCase().includes(lowerFilter) || p.category.toLowerCase().includes(lowerFilter),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return [...result].sort((a, b) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      if (sortBy === 'name') return a.name.localeCompare(b.name);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return a.price - b.price;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, [products, filter, sortBy, showInStockOnly]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;input value={filter} onChange={(e) => setFilter(e.target.value)} placeholder=\"搜索...\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;select value={sortBy} onChange={(e) => setSortBy(e.target.value as 'name' | 'price')}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;option value=\"name\">按名称&#x3C;/option></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;option value=\"price\">按价格&#x3C;/option></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/select></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;label></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;input type=\"checkbox\" checked={showInStockOnly} onChange={(e) => setShowInStockOnly(e.target.checked)} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        仅显示有货</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/label></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {filteredAndSorted.map((product) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;ProductItem key={product.id} product={product} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"usecallback-缓存函数引用\">useCallback：缓存函数引用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { useCallback, memo, useState } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface TodoItemProps {&#10;  id: string;&#10;  text: string;&#10;  completed: boolean;&#10;  onToggle: (id: string) =&gt; void;&#10;  onDelete: (id: string) =&gt; void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const TodoItem = memo(function TodoItem({ id, text, completed, onToggle, onDelete }: TodoItemProps) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div className={`todo-item ${completed ? &#39;completed&#39; : &#39;&#39;}`}&gt;&#10;      &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; checked={completed} onChange={() =&gt; onToggle(id)} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;span&gt;{text}&lt;/span&gt;&#10;      &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; onDelete(id)}&gt;删除&lt;/button&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;});&#10;&#10;function TodoList() {&#10;  const [todos, setTodos] = useState&lt;Array&lt;{ id: string; text: string; completed: boolean }&gt;&gt;([]);&#10;&#10;  const handleToggle = useCallback((id: string) =&gt; {&#10;    setTodos((prev) =&gt; prev.map((todo) =&gt; (todo.id === id ? { ...todo, completed: !todo.completed } : todo)));&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  const handleDelete = useCallback((id: string) =&gt; {&#10;    setTodos((prev) =&gt; prev.filter((todo) =&gt; todo.id !== id));&#10;  }, []);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      {todos.map((todo) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;TodoItem&#10;          key={todo.id}&#10;          id={todo.id}&#10;          text={todo.text}&#10;          completed={todo.completed}&#10;          onToggle={handleToggle}&#10;          onDelete={handleDelete}&#10;        /&gt;&#10;      ))}&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { useCallback, memo, useState } from 'react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface TodoItemProps {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  id: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  text: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  completed: boolean;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  onToggle: (id: string) => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  onDelete: (id: string) => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const TodoItem = memo(function TodoItem({ id, text, completed, onToggle, onDelete }: TodoItemProps) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div className={`todo-item ${completed ? 'completed' : ''}`}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;input type=\"checkbox\" checked={completed} onChange={() => onToggle(id)} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;span>{text}&#x3C;/span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;button onClick={() => onDelete(id)}>删除&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function TodoList() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [todos, setTodos] = useState&#x3C;Array&#x3C;{ id: string; text: string; completed: boolean }>>([]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const handleToggle = useCallback((id: string) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setTodos((prev) => prev.map((todo) => (todo.id === id ? { ...todo, completed: !todo.completed } : todo)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const handleDelete = useCallback((id: string) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setTodos((prev) => prev.filter((todo) => todo.id !== id));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {todos.map((todo) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;TodoItem</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          key={todo.id}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          id={todo.id}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          text={todo.text}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          completed={todo.completed}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          onToggle={handleToggle}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          onDelete={handleDelete}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"状态管理优化\">状态管理优化</h2><h3 id=\"状态下沉\">状态下沉</h3><p>将频繁变化的状态下沉到最需要它的子组件中，避免不相关组件的重渲染。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function Page() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;Header /&gt;&#10;      &lt;SearchSection /&gt;&#10;      &lt;ProductGrid /&gt;&#10;      &lt;Footer /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function SearchSection() {&#10;  const [query, setQuery] = useState(&#39;&#39;);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;input value={query} onChange={(e) =&gt; setQuery(e.target.value)} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;SearchResults query={query} /&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function Page() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Header /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;SearchSection /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;ProductGrid /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Footer /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function SearchSection() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [query, setQuery] = useState('');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;input value={query} onChange={(e) => setQuery(e.target.value)} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;SearchResults query={query} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"context-优化\">Context 优化</h3><p>Context 值变化会导致所有消费组件重渲染。拆分 Context 可以减少影响范围。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { createContext, useContext, useState, memo } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;const ThemeContext = createContext&lt;{ theme: string; setTheme: (t: string) =&gt; void }&gt;({&#10;  theme: &#39;light&#39;,&#10;  setTheme: () =&gt; {},&#10;});&#10;&#10;const UserContext = createContext&lt;{ user: any; setUser: (u: any) =&gt; void }&gt;({&#10;  user: null,&#10;  setUser: () =&gt; {},&#10;});&#10;&#10;function ThemeProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  const [theme, setTheme] = useState(&#39;light&#39;);&#10;  const value = useMemo(() =&gt; ({ theme, setTheme }), [theme]);&#10;  return &lt;ThemeContext.Provider value={value}&gt;{children}&lt;/ThemeContext.Provider&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function UserProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  const [user, setUser] = useState(null);&#10;  const value = useMemo(() =&gt; ({ user, setUser }), [user]);&#10;  return &lt;UserContext.Provider value={value}&gt;{children}&lt;/UserContext.Provider&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { createContext, useContext, useState, memo } from 'react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const ThemeContext = createContext&#x3C;{ theme: string; setTheme: (t: string) => void }>({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  theme: 'light',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  setTheme: () => {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const UserContext = createContext&#x3C;{ user: any; setUser: (u: any) => void }>({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  user: null,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  setUser: () => {},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function ThemeProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [theme, setTheme] = useState('light');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const value = useMemo(() => ({ theme, setTheme }), [theme]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;ThemeContext.Provider value={value}>{children}&#x3C;/ThemeContext.Provider>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function UserProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [user, setUser] = useState(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const value = useMemo(() => ({ user, setUser }), [user]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;UserContext.Provider value={value}>{children}&#x3C;/UserContext.Provider>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"usetransition-与并发渲染\">useTransition 与并发渲染</h2><p>React 18 的 <code>useTransition</code> 将更新标记为低优先级，允许高优先级更新（用户输入）打断低优先级更新（列表过滤）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { useState, useTransition } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;function FilterableList({ items }: { items: string[] }) {&#10;  const [query, setQuery] = useState(&#39;&#39;);&#10;  const [filteredItems, setFilteredItems] = useState(items);&#10;  const [isPending, startTransition] = useTransition();&#10;&#10;  const handleChange = (e: React.ChangeEvent&lt;HTMLInputElement&gt;) =&gt; {&#10;    const value = e.target.value;&#10;    setQuery(value);&#10;&#10;    startTransition(() =&gt; {&#10;      const filtered = items.filter((item) =&gt; item.toLowerCase().includes(value.toLowerCase()));&#10;      setFilteredItems(filtered);&#10;    });&#10;  };&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;input value={query} onChange={handleChange} placeholder=&quot;搜索...&quot; /&gt;&#10;      {isPending &amp;&amp; &lt;span className=&quot;loading&quot;&gt;更新中...&lt;/span&gt;}&#10;      &lt;ul style={{ opacity: isPending ? 0.7 : 1 }}&gt;&#10;        {filteredItems.map((item, i) =&gt; (&#10;          &lt;li key={i}&gt;{item}&lt;/li&gt;&#10;        ))}&#10;      &lt;/ul&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { useState, useTransition } from 'react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function FilterableList({ items }: { items: string[] }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [query, setQuery] = useState('');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [filteredItems, setFilteredItems] = useState(items);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [isPending, startTransition] = useTransition();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const handleChange = (e: React.ChangeEvent&#x3C;HTMLInputElement>) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const value = e.target.value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setQuery(value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    startTransition(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const filtered = items.filter((item) => item.toLowerCase().includes(value.toLowerCase()));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      setFilteredItems(filtered);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;input value={query} onChange={handleChange} placeholder=\"搜索...\" /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {isPending &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;span className=\"loading\">更新中...&#x3C;/span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;ul style={{ opacity: isPending ? 0.7 : 1 }}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {filteredItems.map((item, i) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;li key={i}>{item}&#x3C;/li></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/ul></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"渲染优化决策树\">渲染优化决策树</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[组件渲染性能问题] --&gt; B{是否不必要的重渲染?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C{Props 没变但仍渲染?}&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{渲染本身太慢?}&#10;&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E[&quot;使用 React.memo&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|回调函数变化| F[&quot;使用 useCallback&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|对象/数组变化| G[&quot;使用 useMemo 稳定引用&quot;]&#10;&#10;    D --&gt;|计算密集| H[&quot;useMemo 缓存计算&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|列表太长| I[&quot;虚拟滚动&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|状态范围太大| J[&quot;状态下沉 / 拆分 Context&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|低优先级更新| K[&quot;useTransition / useDeferredValue&quot;]&#10;\">graph TD\n    A[组件渲染性能问题] --&gt; B{是否不必要的重渲染?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C{Props 没变但仍渲染?}\n    B --&gt;|否| D{渲染本身太慢?}\n\n    C --&gt;|是| E[\"使用 React.memo\"]\n    C --&gt;|回调函数变化| F[\"使用 useCallback\"]\n    C --&gt;|对象/数组变化| G[\"使用 useMemo 稳定引用\"]\n\n    D --&gt;|计算密集| H[\"useMemo 缓存计算\"]\n    D --&gt;|列表太长| I[\"虚拟滚动\"]\n    D --&gt;|状态范围太大| J[\"状态下沉 / 拆分 Context\"]\n    D --&gt;|低优先级更新| K[\"useTransition / useDeferredValue\"]\n</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能检测工具\">性能检测工具</h2><h3 id=\"react-devtools-profiler\">React DevTools Profiler</h3><p>React DevTools 的 Profiler 面板可以记录每次渲染，显示哪些组件被渲染、渲染耗时、渲染原因。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>颜色</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>行动</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>灰色</td>\n<td>本次未渲染</td>\n<td>优化有效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蓝色</td>\n<td>渲染快速（&lt; 1ms）</td>\n<td>通常无需优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>黄色</td>\n<td>渲染较慢（1-16ms）</td>\n<td>考虑优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红色</td>\n<td>渲染很慢（&gt; 16ms）</td>\n<td>必须优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"自定义渲染追踪\">自定义渲染追踪</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { useRef, useEffect } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;function useRenderCount(componentName: string): void {&#10;  const count = useRef(0);&#10;  count.current++;&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    if (process.env.NODE_ENV === &#39;development&#39;) {&#10;      console.log(`[Render] ${componentName}: ${count.current} times`);&#10;    }&#10;  });&#10;}&#10;&#10;function useWhyDidYouRender(componentName: string, props: Record&lt;string, any&gt;): void {&#10;  const prevProps = useRef&lt;Record&lt;string, any&gt;&gt;(props);&#10;&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    if (process.env.NODE_ENV === &#39;development&#39;) {&#10;      const changes: Record&lt;string, { from: any; to: any }&gt; = {};&#10;&#10;      for (const key of Object.keys(props)) {&#10;        if (prevProps.current[key] !== props[key]) {&#10;          changes[key] = { from: prevProps.current[key], to: props[key] };&#10;        }&#10;      }&#10;&#10;      if (Object.keys(changes).length &gt; 0) {&#10;        console.log(`[WhyRender] ${componentName}:`, changes);&#10;      }&#10;&#10;      prevProps.current = props;&#10;    }&#10;  });&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { useRef, useEffect } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'react'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> useRenderCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">componentName</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-